    <edge source="&quot;ENUMERATION_AND_SORTING&quot;" target="&quot;CONTROL_STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">69.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Control structures enable the enumeration of all grid cells to find the maximum value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Enumeration and sorting are not directly related to control structures here."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sorting frequencies requires control structures to manage the iteration and ordering of data."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Control_Structure manages the iteration over subarrays, while Enumeration_and_Sorting is used to compare elements, but the combination does not fully address the problem's requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's code uses Control_Structure to implement Enumeration_and_Sorting by iterating through subarrays and checking conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student uses sorting (Enumeration_and_Sorting) within control structures to process the array, demonstrating integration of concepts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's code uses Control_Structure, but no errors are noted in Enumeration_and_Sorting, implying proficiency."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-52330c48254eb28040891fc6658900e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb266f676f817ae1da7faf5ef3318979&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ec9ea4c664af3656c0682232565f07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c7b71846906cd22045a6e706147e16a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea00e0f2c81dc0fc8cf34f9d8c29edd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7f29f281e82943a6275eeb375551e96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cb0afca86b9a6d34b643302669895ff</data>
